maluos-agents (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First version (Phase 12 slice 8, the Agents app): maluos-agents, a
    WebKitGTK window over the session's state listing the local agents and
    the office's, with Talk (the task interface of maluos_agent_tasks,
    local socket or the office's task URL), Control (AgentAction, logs,
    a one-off command), Policy (delegations and grants from the vault,
    the office's card), Memory (the agent's compartment) and Activity (the
    vault's ledger, the office's activity endpoint); the office's own page
    for an agent loads beside it. `maluos-agents --sync` writes the icons:
    launchers, the Agents app folder in the grid, ~/Desktop/Agents.

 -- Edward Honour <ed@maludb.org>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
